  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carbon Fund of the Carbon Partnership Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The CPF concept and development objectives were discussed and approved  by the World Bank Board of Directors on September 25, 2007. The CPF is  aimed at promoting demonstration, strategic, and transformational  programmatic Emission Reduction (ER) activities.
 
 The CPF Carbon Fund will focus on payments for ER credits from Progams  developed by Sellers in the Facility. The CPF Carbon Fund will have  several tranches, and the information on the presented here is based  on an assumption of a Euro 350 million first tranche only.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
